{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":95,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܬܹܝܡܘܼܢ ܫܲܒܚܲܚ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܘܸܚܲܚ ܠܐܝܼܨܵܪܵܐ ܕܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܲܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܬܲܚ ܩܲܕܡ ܦܵܬܹܗ ܒܫܲܟܲܪܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܘܸܚܲܚ ܐܸܠܹܗ ܒܙܡܵܪܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܓܘܼܪܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܡܲܠܟܵܐ ܓܘܼܪܵܐ ܥܲܠܔ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܐܲܠܵܗܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܕܒܐܝܼܕܹܗ ܝܢܵܐ ܥܘܼܡܩܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܕܝܼܹܗ ܝܢܵܐ ܪܹ̈ܝܫܹܐ ܕܛܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܝܼܹܗ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܝܵܡܵܐ ܘܗ̇ܘ ܥܒ݂ܝܼܕܵܐ ܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܐܝܼܕܵܬܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܓܒ݂ܝܼܠܔ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܒܸܪܙܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܹܝܡܘܼܢ ܣܵܓ݂ܕܲܚ ܘܟܵܝܦܲܚ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܵܪܟܲܚ ܩܲܕܡ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܵܪܝܵܢܲܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܗ̇ܘ ܝܼܠܹܗ ܐܲܠܵܗܲܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܐܲܚܢܲܢ ܥܲܡܵܐ ܕܡܲܪܥܝܼܬܹܗ ܘܥܸܪ̈ܒܹܐ ܕܓܵܘ ܐܝܼܕܹܗ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܕܝܘܿܡ ܐܸܢ ܩܵܠܹܗ ܫܵܡܥܝܼܬܘܿܢ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܵܐ ܡܲܩܫܹܝܬܘܿܢ ܠܸܒܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ ܕܵܐܟ݂ܝܼ ܕܓܵܘ ܡܪܝܼܒ݂ܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܕܡܲܣܵܐ ܓܵܘ ܒܲܪܝܼܵܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܕܓ̰ܘܼܪܒܸܢܗܘܿܢ ܐܲܒ݂ܵܗܵܬܵܘ̈ܟ݂ܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܨܘܼܚܨܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܸܠܝܼ، ܐܵܦܸܢ ܚܸܙܝܹܐ ܝܗܘܵܘ ܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܪܒܥܝܼ ܫܸܢܹ̈ܐ ܣܩܝܼܕ ܠܝܼ ܒܗ̇ܘ ܕܵܪܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܐܡܝܼܪܝܼ: ܥܲܡܵܐ ܚܵܠܛܵܢܵܐ ܒܠܸܒܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܐܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܐܵܢܝܼ ܠܵܐ ܝܕܝܼܥ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܘܼܪ̈ܚܵܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܬ ܐܵܗܵܐ، ܝܡܹܐ ܠܝܼ ܒܟܲܪܒܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܠܹܐ ܥܵܒ݂ܪܝܼ ܠܢܝܵܚܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/95.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/96.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/94.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}